                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/1802.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the American Ambassador.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-05-20"><hi rendition="#italic">May 20,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 351.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Department acknowledges the receipt of
                    your No. 535, of the 10th instant, with which you transmit a copy of a note
                    [etc.]. The Department approves the action you have taken in the matter.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">P. C. Knox.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
